{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000771","compactId":"SO_0000771","id":"SO:0000771","label":"QTL","definition":{"text":"A quantitative trait locus (QTL) is a polymorphic locus which contains alleles that differentially affect the expression of a continuously distributed phenotypic trait. Usually it is a marker described by statistical association to quantitative variation in the particular phenotypic trait that is thought to be controlled by the cumulative action of alleles at multiple loci.","xrefs":["http://rgd.mcw.edu/tu/qtls/"]},"comments":["Added in respose to request by Simon Twigger November 14th 2005."],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"quantitative trait locus"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":[],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000771/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","commit":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","subject":"Add renamed SO files","summary":"Term introduced into the editable ontology history","details":["Initial label: QTL","Initial definition captured.","Initial parent: SO:0001411"],"issueRefs":[]}]},"parents":["SO:0001411"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001411"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001411","id":"SO:0001411","label":"b